      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yea welcome to vrchat. I dont know specifically what you are referring to but the devs are yet to acknowledge if they are actually looking into fixing the asset bundle memory leak issue. The intended behaviour is for you to change worlds to clear memory, but that doesn't even work properly. RAM and VRAM are the one major upgrades you need to be able to play in large instances in VR.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
