      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}: What I notice is after the newest network update, the performance hit on VRAM usage is worse, leading to drop even more fps and shutter. I installed clear VRAM mod and it seems to work alright, though not every time.\nInterestingly, VRCHAT only use about 5-8Gb on RAM, and completely fill up all 10Gb of VRAM on the 3080.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
