      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat will move asset data from VRAM to RAM once it hits the limit, when people constantly join instance and leave, this will grow up with times the new asset be loaded, and when you stay at instance long enough, RAM will also be filled with asset data come from VRAM.\nPlus, it is long-stand situation since start.",
      "viewerReactions": null
